invariant: INV-17
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: A refused RSA key file leaves the integers the call read in the
  caller's key. Every refusal in test_files and test_written requires
  the key zeroed.

--- old
    if (!ok) {
        ct_wipe(key, sizeof *key);
        return CH_EINVAL;
--- new
    if (!ok) {
        return CH_EINVAL;
